  "slug": "courier-pickup-report-form",
  "title": "Courier Pickup Completion and Exception Report",
  "subtitle": "Record actual timing, package reconciliation, condition evidence, custody, service variance, and accountable closure after pickup.",
  "description": "A post-pickup operational report that reconciles the dispatch commitment with actual events, package and seal condition, exceptions, downstream custody, final disposition, proof, billing impact, corrective action, and review.",
  "use_case": "Use after courier pickup when operations, customer service, and the sender need an evidence-backed record of what was accepted, what changed, where custody moved, and how every package and exception was closed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
